graph LR
  APIGW[Kong API Gateway]
  subgraph Services
    AUTH[auth-service :3001]
    USER[user-service :3002]
    ACADEMIC[academic-service :3003]
    ANALYTICS[analytics-service :3004]
    PRED[prediction-service :3006]
  end
  subgraph Databases
    PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>mentorapredict)]
    REDIS[(Redis)]
  end
  EXT[OpenAI API]

  APIGW -->|/api/v1/auth| AUTH
  APIGW -->|/api/v1/users| USER
  APIGW -->|/api/v1/academic| ACADEMIC
  APIGW -->|/api/v1/analytics<br/>/api/v1/notifications<br/>/api/socket.io| ANALYTICS
  APIGW -->|/api/v1/prediction| PRED

  AUTH --> PG
  USER --> PG
  ACADEMIC --> PG
  ANALYTICS --> PG
  PRED --> PG

  AUTH --> REDIS
  ANALYTICS --> REDIS

  PRED --> EXT

  AUTH -.->|internal, sync profile| USER
  USER -.->|internal, auth sync| AUTH
  USER -.->|internal, deactivation eligibility| ACADEMIC
  USER -.->|internal, notify| ANALYTICS
  ACADEMIC -.->|internal, metrics/notify| ANALYTICS
  ACADEMIC -.->|internal, user lookup| USER
  ANALYTICS -.->|internal, academic context| ACADEMIC
  ANALYTICS -.->|internal, recalc| PRED
  PRED -.->|internal, risk snapshot| ANALYTICS
  PRED -.->|internal, academic context| ACADEMIC
